hamsterdan-host
Copyright 2026 Seasoned

This package is a Haskell port of the Hamsterdan host
(https://github.com/henriquebastos/hamsterdan), pinned under
upstream/hamsterdan. It follows the behavior of src/hamsterdan/host/*.py
(service, api, binding, runnable, git_publish, __main__) and
src/hamsterdan/host/v5/*.py, and its test suite ports the upstream tests in
tests/unit/host/ and tests/integration/host/.

